# Architecture 6: Epoch Chaining / Forward Propagation

title: {
  label: "Architecture 6: Epoch Chaining / Forward Propagation\nChain attitude candidates across consecutive epochs via Euler equations & omega-consistency filtering.\nExponential culling via forward/backward passes narrows candidates to 0-5 survivors."
  near: top-center
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 24
  style.bold: true
}

