}

funnel: "CANDIDATE FUNNEL\n\n5k-10k seeds/epoch -> ~100 cands/epoch (Block 2)\n100x100 pairs -> ~100-1000 survive per link (Block 3)\nAfter full chain -> ~10-50 paths (Block 4+5)\nConservation filter -> 0-5 survivors (Block 6)\nFull LC ranking -> 1 solution (Block 7)" {
