footer: "Test Case: Intelsat 901 (~10k facets) | True: q0 from axis=[0.6,0.3,0.8]/norm, angle=45 deg | omega0=[0.5,-0.3,2.0] deg/s | 3600s window, 500 epochs\nKey Strength: Exponential culling - each chain link eliminates ~90-99%. 10 links -> survival ~ 1e-10 to 1e-20 of initial space." {
  near: bottom-center
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 13
  style.font-color: "#2C3E50"
}
